# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Safari and an image held down, with no fingers and no network (the image is in the link: a data: URL) (rwtouch injects the touches through /dev/hakios-touch): three minutes after the start
# (Wi-Fi and the network configuration are ready by then) a picture is opened by a link, left to load, held for 1.5 seconds in the
# middle (what Safari does for a held image: the menu and the QR-code scan that once crashed it), and let go; then the home button.
# Screenshots from the PC (xl screenshot) show what each step did.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 150
/redwood/bin/battery_test open data:image/png;base64,
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 25 hold 0.5 0.38 1500 wait 8
/redwood/bin/rwtouch button home wait 5
/redwood/bin/battery_test open prefs:root=WIFI
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20 button home wait 5
